      "notes": "$\\alpha(S)$ and $\\mu(S)$ are parameters of the sequence $S=\\langle S_1,\\dots\\rangle$ defined in [Das2020Luminous] (equation 1 and Theorem 18). Checked against the full text (HAL copy of the IEEE Access version).",
